OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister 'gobsmacked' by    
OL,4,ABurnham's devolution calls rejection   
OL,6,FWelsh First Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth  
OL,7,Fhas said he is "pretty gobsmacked"     
OL,8,Fafter long-standing calls for certain  
OL,9,Fpowers to be transferred from          
OL,10,FWestminster to Cardiff were rejected.  
OL,12,FIn a letter to ap Iorwerth, Prime      
OL,13,FMinister Andy Burnham said he was "not 
OL,14,Fpersuaded" by the case to devolve      
OL,15,Fresponsibilities over policing and     
OL,16,Fjustice, the Crown Estate and rail     
OL,17,Finfrastructure to Wales.               
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
