OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister 'gobsmacked' by    
OL,4,ABurnham's devolution calls rejection   
OL,6,FThe first minister told BBC Radio Wales
OL,7,Fbreakfast that "this is about          
OL,8,FWestminster saying, we decide, it      
OL,9,Fdoesn't matter what the people of Wales
OL,10,Fthink".                                
OL,12,FSecretary of State for Wales Stephen   
OL,13,FKinnock said the changes would have led
OL,14,Fto "destabilisation and fragmentation  
OL,15,Fand disintegration".                   
